{"name": "Sandcaster", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An action adventure combining exploration with puzzle solving. Learn the Sandcaster secrets through environmental storytelling, where the backgrounds and biomes piece together a quiet narrative beneath it's shifting sands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover Ancient Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape your path as you unearth ancient abilities and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541450/extras/c4df44055084d3b9975ab56c74a1500e.poster.avif?t=1783616142\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541450/extras/c4df44055084d3b9975ab56c74a1500e.webm?t=1783616142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541450/extras/c4df44055084d3b9975ab56c74a1500e.mp4?t=1783616142\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Harness Abilities to Unravel Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each ability reshapes how you interact with puzzles, combat, and the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541450/extras/a575d299cd666554f6788400ae5aa707.poster.avif?t=1783616142\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4541450/extras/a575d299cd666554f6788400ae5aa707.webm?t=1783616142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"